OL,3,GNEWSAMurder suspect's mum accused of
OL,4,Awithholding information
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a man charged with
OL,7,Fmurdering Carrie Mullane has appeared
OL,8,Fin court charged with withholding
OL,9,Finformation from police.
OL,11,FCarrie Mullane, 39, had been missing
OL,12,Fsince she arrived in Enniskillen,
OL,13,FCounty Fermanagh, from Limerick on 10
OL,14,FOctober 2026.
OL,16,FA body was recovered by police from
OL,17,FLough Erne on Monday and the formal
OL,18,Fidentification process is still
OL,19,Fongoing. A sunken boat was also
OL,20,Fdiscovered in the water.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
